    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"undeniable\" is a pretty strong word to use for a market forecast. what about the supply chain issues? i'm seeing a lot of talk about the massive shortage of lithium and cobalt, plus the stability of the grid with intermittent wind and solar. wouldn't those be huge red flags that could stall this whole transition?",
